== every line of the brief that mentions a ceiling, ICC, REML, a formula, J_i or a site mean:
20:- **Exploratory transfer results.** The transfer penalty between continents is small. The binding limit is that climate explains little within any continent (R² 0.06–0.45) against a same-site agreement of ICC 0.62–0.82.
114:3. **Noise ceiling.** Rerun E1 and N3 with a 3-level REML model (site / study within site / record) by continent. Report both ceilings: for a new record from the same study, and for one from an independent study.
171:5. Continent transfer matrix, with within-continent benchmark and noise ceilings.
